 - **REQ-B-2 Intents** are a closed, versioned set: `MoveTo`, `FollowRoute`, `SetSpeed`, `SetHeading`, `Hold`, `Fire{target, weapon}`, `Spawn`, `Despawn`, `Custom{kind,payload}`.
